_DINING_PRICE_RANGE"],"每個人平均花費多少？",[[[["E:TWD_200_TO_400"],"$200-400",2,null,"$200 到 $400","0ahUKEwjG_K2PwdKWAxV4nK8BHRuKD7EQ3YcHCFMoAA"]],1],null,null,"平均每人消費金額",null,"0ahUKEwjG_K2PwdKWAxV4nK8BHRuKD7EQ3IcHCFIoBQ",null,null,null,null,null,1,[[2]],2],[["GUIDED_DINING_FOOD_ASPECT"],"餐點",null,null,null,"餐點",null,"0ahUKEwjG_K2PwdKWAxV4nK8BHRuKD7EQ3IcHCFQoBg",null,null,null,[4],null,2,null,1],[["GUIDED_DINING_SERVICE_ASPECT"],"服務",null,null,null,"服務",null,"0ahUKEwjG_K2PwdKWAxV4nK8BHRuKD7EQ3IcHCFUoBw",null,null,null,[4],null,2,null,1],[["GUIDED_DINING_ATMOSPHERE_ASPECT"],"氣氛",null,null,null,"氣氛",null,"0ahUKEwjG_K2PwdKWAxV4nK8BHRuKD7EQ3IcHCFYoCA",null,null,null,[5],null,2,null,1],[["GUIDED_DINING_NOISE_LEVEL"],"你覺得吵雜程度如何？",[[[["E:DINING_NOISE_LEVEL_LOUD"],"吵雜，但還是能交談",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwjG_K2PwdKWAxV4nK8BHRuKD7EQ3YcHCFgoAA"]],1],null,null,"吵雜程度",null,"0ahUKEwjG_K2PwdKWAxV4nK8BHRuKD7EQ3IcHCFcoCQ",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_GROUP_SIZE"],"這裡適合幾個人的聚會？",null,[[[["E:DINING_GROUP_SIZE_SUITABLE_FOR_ALL"],"多人聚餐/單人用餐皆宜",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwjG_K2PwdKWAxV4nK8BHRuKD7EQ3YcHCFooAA"]]],null,"用餐人數",null,"0ahUKEwjG_K2PwdKWAxV4nK8BHRuKD7EQ3IcHCFkoCg",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["雞白湯拉麵 360 元\n\n點綴有玉米筍、甜椒、雞叉燒、洋蔥、南瓜、白蘿蔔、金桔、蔥白、豆苗，看似多樣，但其實真的就是點綴，沒有太多實際提味作用。有附上炸洋蔥絲和薑泥。\n\n湯頭確實濃郁，奶香味很重，但建議吃到中後段開始一定要開始自行適量調味，因為後勁開始上來會變鹹，也會覺得吃得很膩。\n我是加入柴魚醋讓湯頭變成另一種風味。\n\n麵體和舒肥豬肉片表現，相較之下非常遜色。\n\n店家使用自助點餐機，可刷卡、linepay以及載具。\n\n整體店內環境整潔，開放式廚房，廚區、座位區無油膩感。雖然是吧台座位，但非常寬敞，不需要像其他拉麵店一樣人擠人的擁擠感。\n\n週一 11:30 來到店內時沒人，但 12:00 用餐時間一到，客人就陸續進來了。",null,[0,83]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/10507699573977237357/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBLUmxKSVZrZFVhMFp4VjI1S2RsZ3hXazFsVjNONVdsZGtiVmRJWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/10507699573977237357/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBLUmxKSVZrZFVhMFp4VjI1S2RsZ3hXazFsVjNONVdsZGtiVmRJWXhBQhAA"